%% Notes
%% Flujo de datos completo del Integrated Risk Decision Engine.
%% N1 (Sanctions) consume Entity payload + Auth context (tenant derivation).
%% N2 (Dual-Use) consume Product + Geo payload.
%% N3 (Routes) consume Geo payload + OSINT externo + ML forecasts + Geo store.
%% Los mapas (rendering frontend) consumen GeoJSON de corredores + eventos
%% georreferenciados + buffer polygons calculados por geo impact engine +
%% vessel position via AIS opcional.
%% Marine Cargo Insurance es cross-cutting: consume decisions de N1+N2+N3
%% para calcular premium.
%% Risk Aggregator consolida las 4 senales, aplica pesos por tenant,
%% emite decision final con explicabilidad.
%% Audit log append-only recibe decisions de cada nivel + final.
%% UI consumers: dashboard, Centro de Comando (L1+L2+L3+L5), mapa,
%% case detail, regulatory intelligence.
